WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.024 --> 00:00:04.301
Roxy glanced at her friends.

2
00:00:04.302 --> 00:00:06.514
"Oh no!" she said.

3
00:00:06.515 --> 00:00:09.247
"What's wrong?" asked Mara.

4
00:00:09.248 --> 00:00:12.643
"I forgot a book at the library," said Roxy.

5
00:00:12.644 --> 00:00:17.514
"You all go home. I'll take the next bus."

6
00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:20.348
Roxy ran down the crowded sidewalk.

7
00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:25.461
"Wait!" called Terrell. "We can help find the book!"

8
00:00:25.462 --> 00:00:28.911
But Roxy was already gone.

9
00:00:28.912 --> 00:00:32.368
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

10
00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:36.588
Swoosh! Roxy zoomed across the sky.

11
00:00:36.589 --> 00:00:40.685
She flew right to the car show.

12
00:00:40.686 --> 00:00:43.708
The front doors of the convention center were shattered.

13
00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:46.388
Bits of glass lay everywhere.

14
00:00:46.389 --> 00:00:49.627
Several cars in the parking lot were smashed.

15
00:00:49.628 --> 00:00:53.121
Detective Smith stood near the shattered doors.

16
00:00:53.122 --> 00:00:56.314
He was talking to Mayor Bloom and some other people.

17
00:00:56.315 --> 00:00:58.730
One man wore a lab coat.

18
00:00:58.731 --> 00:01:01.799
Roxy landed next to the detective and grinned.

19
00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:05.678
"Shopping for a new car, Detective?"

20
00:01:05.679 --> 00:01:09.967
"This is no time for jokes," said the detective.

21
00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:13.643
"Car theft is a serious crime."

22
00:01:13.644 --> 00:01:17.858
"It isn't just any car," said the man in the lab coat.

23
00:01:17.859 --> 00:01:20.687
"It's the Ultra Car!"

24
00:01:20.688 --> 00:01:24.390
"Why is it called the Ultra Car?" Roxy asked.

25
00:01:24.391 --> 00:01:28.315
"It's the most amazing car ever invented!" said the man.

26
00:01:28.316 --> 00:01:32.746
"It's as tough as an army tank. It has lasers.

27
00:01:32.747 --> 00:01:36.755
It can go under water and even fly!"

28
00:01:36.756 --> 00:01:41.569
Roxy gulped. The car could do all of those things.

29
00:01:41.570 --> 00:01:45.766
And now a thief had it . . . This was bad news.

30
00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:49.679
"Did anyone see who stole it?" Roxy asked.

31
00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:54.216
The inventor shook his head. Mayor Bloom did too.

32
00:01:54.217 --> 00:01:59.005
A woman rushed over. She wore lots of diamonds.

33
00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:02.229
"I know who took the car," she said.

34
00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:09.728
Roxy recognized her. She was Victoria Cash, the richest woman in Metro City.

35
00:02:09.729 --> 00:02:14.618
"You know who the thief is?" said Roxy. "Who is it?"

36
00:02:14.619 --> 00:02:17.930
Mrs. Cash dabbed her eyes with a handkerchief.

37
00:02:17.931 --> 00:02:26.020
"It wasn't a thief," she said. "It was my daughter, Ruby."

38
00:02:26.021 --> 00:02:30.578
"Why would Ruby steal a car?" asked Detective Smith.

39
00:02:30.579 --> 00:02:34.013
"She didn't mean to," said Mrs. Cash.

40
00:02:34.014 --> 00:02:40.336
"She wanted to ride in the Ultra Car, but I told her no." She sighed.

41
00:02:40.337 --> 00:02:43.989
"Ruby doesn't like to hear the word 'no.'"

42
00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:48.196
"Ruby sounds a little spoiled," thought Roxy.

43
00:02:48.197 --> 00:02:52.504
"I just turned my back for a moment," Mrs. Cash went on.

44
00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:55.444
"Ruby must have gotten into the car.

45
00:02:55.445 --> 00:02:59.410
A moment later the car took off!"

46
00:02:59.411 --> 00:03:01.644
Detective Smith's phone rang.

47
00:03:01.645 --> 00:03:08.030
"Smith here," the detective said. "Really? Oh no!"

48
00:03:08.031 --> 00:03:11.153
He put his phone away and looked at Roxy.

49
00:03:11.154 --> 00:03:20.133
"The Ultra Car is destroying downtown Metro City!"

